∇ lines←IcsEvents ics;l;b;e;i
 ⍝ The class meetings calendar text ics describes, as sorted EventLines. Reads what
 ⍝ the calendar means, not how it is written, so a correct change of format (CRLF,
 ⍝ folding, escaping, UID/DTSTAMP, VTIMEZONE, UTC times, EXDATE) still matches.
  l←Unfold ics
  b←⍸l≡¨⊂'BEGIN:VEVENT' ⋄ e←⍸l≡¨⊂'END:VEVENT'
  :If (≢b)≢≢e ⋄ 'Unbalanced BEGIN/END:VEVENT'⎕SIGNAL 11 ⋄ :EndIf
  lines←⍬
  :For i :In ⍳≢b
      lines,←OneEvent l[b[i]+⍳e[i]-b[i]+1]
  :EndFor
  lines←lines[⍋lines]
∇
